 "truth_method": "Ball: purple HSV blob chain (work/truth/hsv_chain.py) seeded by eye, refined to a Lab b* mask bounding box (refine.py), cross-checked against yolo11n_bowling.pt boxes at conf 0.1 (yolo_cands.json), and eye-checked on 3x gridded crops (gc_<f>.jpg, montage_*.jpg) with the fitted circle drawn; frames with src 'eye-confirmed' were looked at, 'chain-refined' frames lie between them on the same smooth chain and were not individually inspected; 'manual' = read off the crop by hand. Centres +-5 px for r>20, +-2 px for r<15. Lane: edge scans (intensity and Lab b*) on rows of the source frame, straight-line fits where rows agree, visual reads on gridded crops for the motion-smeared release+10 frames. Board: edge profile at several late frames plus the 7-column pin ruler (7-pin to 10-pin = 36 in) with and without a perspective correction; board = middle of all reads rounded to 0.5, uncertainty = half their spread, floored at 1.0. 'ball' uses the {x,y,r,src} dict of the three 09-19 truth files, not [x,y,r], so one scorer reads all six.",
